    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "pandas.Period.day# Period.day# Get day of the month that a Period falls on. Returns: int See also Period.dayofweekGet the day of the week. Period.dayofyearGet the day of the year. Examples >>> p = pd.Period(\"2018-03-11\", freq='H') >>> p.day 11",
